Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:03.01,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fn@HYXuanSong 75S\c&H070C39&\fs25\frz270\pos(1160,515)\fsp6}—關於地球的運動—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:52.23,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}何度でも　何度でも叫ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.61,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.1\blur8\3c&HFFFFFF&}何度でも　何度でも叫ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:54.86,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}何度でも　何度でも叫ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.24,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.1\blur8\3c&HFFFFFF&}何度でも　何度でも叫ぶ
